 R←Test_ListDirs2_002(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;list;path;list2;parms
⍝ Test the `ListDirs2` method on a folder that has read restrictions somewhere down the line.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 :If 'Win'≢APLTreeUtils2.GetOperatingSystem ⍬
     R←T._WindowsOnly
 :Else
     path←(WinSys.ExpandEnv'%SYSTEMROOT%'),'\system32\'
     parms←⎕NS''
     parms.recurse←2
     list←parms ##.FilesAndDirs.ListDirs2 path

    ⍝ First big step: it must not crash!
    ⍝ We should verify the result as well.
     list←APLTreeUtils2.Lowercase list
     list←list[⍋list]

     list2←(0 1)⎕NINFO⍠('Recurse' 2)('Wildcard' 1)⊣path,'*'
     list2←(1=2⊃list2)/1⊃list2
     list2←⎕C list2
     list2←##.FilesAndDirs.NormalizePath list2
     list2←list2[⍋list2]

     →T.PassesIf list≡list2

     R←T._OK
 :EndIf
